      "Section": "Client Credential Flow (2-legged OAuth)",
      "Anchor": "client-credential-flow-2-legged-oauth",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "If your application needs to access APIs that are not member specific, use the Client Credential Flow. Your application cannot access these APIs by default.",
