    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Client Credential Flow (2-legged OAuth)",
      "Anchor": "client-credential-flow-2-legged-oauth",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "Generate a Token Manually Using the Developer Portal \nThe LinkedIn Developer Portal has a token generator for manually creating tokens. Visit the LinkedIn Developer Portal Token Generator or follow the steps outlined in Developer Portal Tools.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret",
      "Anchor": "step-1-get-client-id-and-client-secret",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret"
      ],
      "Text": "Getting started? Create a new application on the Developer Portal.\nExisting application? Go to My apps to modify your app settings.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret",
      "Anchor": "step-1-get-client-id-and-client-secret",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret"
      ],
      "Text": "Each application is assigned a unique Client ID (Consumer key/API key) and Client Secret. Please make a note of these values as they will be integrated into your application config files. Your Client Secret protects your application\u0027s security so be sure to keep it secure!",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret",
      "Anchor": "step-1-get-client-id-and-client-secret",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret"
      ],
      "Text": "Warning",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret",
      "Anchor": "step-1-get-client-id-and-client-secret",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Get Client ID and Client Secret"
      ],
      "Text": "Do not share your Client Secret value with anyone, and do not pass it in the URL when making API calls, or URI query-string parameters, or post in support forums, chat, etc.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 2: Generate an Access Token",
      "Anchor": "step-2-generate-an-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Generate an Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "To generate an access token, issue a HTTP POST against accessToken with a Content-Type header of x-www-form-urlencoded and the following parameters in the request body:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "Step 2: Generate an Access Token",
      "Anchor": "step-2-generate-an-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Generate an Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "https://www.linkedin.com/oauth/v2/accessToken",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "table",
      "Section": "Step 2: Generate an Access Token",
      "Anchor": "step-2-generate-an-access-token",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Generate an Access Token"
      ],
      "Text": "",
      "Headers": [
        "Parameter",
        "Description",
        "Required"
      ],
      "Rows": [
        [
          {
            "Text": "grant_type",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The value of this field should always be client_credentials",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "client_id",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The Client ID value generated when you registered your application",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          }
        ],
        [
          {
            "Text": "client_secret",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The Client Secret value generated when you registered your application. All values requiring URL encoding must be encoded. Client secrets can include characters like /,=,\u002B which require URL encoding.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Yes",
            "Links": [],
